ADDITIONAL NOTES:

This package implements the MITSS (Multiple Imputation using Two 
Subclassification Splines) method described in:

Gutman, R. and Rubin, D.B. (2015). Estimation of causal effects of 
binary treatments in unconfounded studies. Statistics in Medicine, 
34(26), 3381-3398. doi:10.1002/sim.6532

The original method was developed by Roee Gutman and Donald B. Rubin.
This R package implementation is released under GPL-3 license.
